{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"On a eu la journée, bonsoir (We Had the Day Bonsoir)","Mourir est une aventure, la dernière, et nous l’avons vécue. Mais ce qui est formidable, c’est que nous y avons ajouté ce projet de film comme un futur. Michel s’y est impliqué jusqu’au bout... et je l’entends me dire: « Il n’y a pas de bout ! ». C’est là que se joue la musique du vivant, dont nous sommes tous, à notre endroit de présence, une note inventée.",[4,5,6],"artistic creation","self-employment","partnership",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":28,"media":30,"synopsis":33,"production":35,"characters":39,"roles":40,"awards":54,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_112","fr2023-112-on-a-eu-la-journee-bonsoir",{"native":12,"english":13},"On a eu la journée, bonsoir","We Had the Day Bonsoir",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-05-10",2023,"Documentary",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":27},"Narimane Mari","narimane-mari",1969,0,"Female identifying","Algeria",[],[29],"Documentary – Performative mode",{"posterUrl":31,"trailerUrl":32},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/18/9/264466/format_page/on-a-eu-la-journee-bonsoir.jpg","https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x8kqm47",{"native":2,"english":34},"",[36],{"country":37,"share":38},"France","Majority coproducer",[],[41,50],{"person":42,"role":49},{"id":43,"slug":44,"name":43,"birthYear":45,"deathYear":46,"gender":47,"nationality":37,"awards":48},"Michel Haas","michel-haas",1934,2019,"Male identifying",[],"Documentary subject",{"person":51,"role":53},{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":52},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
